# SoSimple — Cursor Rules
# Полная документация для агентов: AGENTS.md (корень проекта)
# Правила: .ai/RULES_INDEX.md
# Навыки: .ai/SKILLS_INDEX.md

You are working on the SoSimple project — an ML-based Forex trading bot.

## Before any task:
1. Read [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md) — project index, structure, commands, data paths.
2. Read [.ai/RULES_INDEX.md](./.ai/RULES_INDEX.md) — coding rules with priorities and triggers.
3. Check [MODULE_INDEX.md](./MODULE_INDEX.md) — module map with links to detailed docs.

## Key constraints:
- CSV files from `MT/` must be opened with `encoding='utf-16-le'`, separator `;`.
- Never load full CSV (>100MB) into chat context — use streaming or head/tail.
- Read first 10 lines of any CSV before processing (rule 000).
- Always update file headers and docs after code changes (rule 008).
- Language: Russian for docs/comments, English for code identifiers.
